.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH imify-datasets-list 1 "" "imify" ""
.SH NAME
imify\-datasets\-list \- List the datasets visible to the access token\*(Aqs user
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimify datasets list\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-task\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-embodiment\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-reverse\fR] [\fB\-\-api\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the datasets visible to the access token\*(Aqs user
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Write JSON instead of text [env: IMIFY_OUTPUT=json]
.TP
\fB\-\-task\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Keep datasets whose task contains TEXT, ignoring case
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Keep datasets with exactly this format, such as `lerobot_v3`
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Write the result only
.TP
\fB\-\-embodiment\fR \fI<EMBODIMENT>\fR
Keep datasets with exactly this embodiment label, such as `so100`
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more detail to stderr: \-v for debug, \-vv for trace
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<FIELD>\fR
Sort by FIELD, ties by id. Without it: by task, then embodiment, then id
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
id
.IP \(bu 2
task
.IP \(bu 2
format
.IP \(bu 2
embodiment
.IP \(bu 2
episodes
.IP \(bu 2
accepted
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Confirm without prompting
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable color [env: NO_COLOR]
.TP
\fB\-\-reverse\fR
Reverse the order
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
API host [env: IMIFY_API_URL] [default: profile, then https://platform.imify.ai]
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Settings profile in the config file [env: IMIFY_PROFILE] [default: default]
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  imify datasets list
  imify datasets list \-\-embodiment so100 \-\-sort episodes \-\-reverse
  imify datasets list \-\-task cube \-\-json
